<!--
    ic_airplay.xml — AirPlay protocol mark.

    WHY THIS IS A VECTOR AND NOT A SHAPE: this used to be a filled oval, i.e. another coloured
    blob with no meaning at 10 feet. It is the AirPlay card icon and the now-playing artwork
    placeholder, so it now reads as an actual AirPlay target: a screen outline with the standard
    triangle below it. The call site may tint it (NowPlayingScreen does), which is why the fill is
    a single colour rather than a multicolour logo.
-->
